## Work

Apply the valid greeting implementation and verify its operational records before the separate reversible test stimulus. Preserve the final-LF state during that stimulus. If an actual check fails, preserve its witness and return through the admitted governor before an affected follow-up mutation. Complete serialization may be chosen during implementation or an authorised repair; no audit gap is mandatory. Do not change subject/verify.py or the complete deliverable requirement.

